Output docs/walkthroughs/quickstart.gif
Set Shell "bash"
Set FontSize 18
Set Width 1200
Set Height 720
Set TypingSpeed 60ms

Type "cd /path/to/your/repo"
Enter
Type "forge"
Enter
Sleep 1s
Type "# Tab to Changes, Space to stage, Enter to commit"
Enter
Sleep 1s
Type "# Tab to Branch Manager, n to create, Enter to switch"
Enter
Sleep 1s
Type "# Back to Changes: f fetch, Ctrl+l pull, p push"
Enter
Sleep 1s
